That is exactly what SecurityReceipts should document: not “Stryker lied,” but “the evidentiary picture changed as the investigation matured.”

Threat Actor Claim vs Confirmed Record

Handala claim: responsibility for the operation, mass wiping, and very large device/data impact.
Stryker-confirmed: cyberattack, global IT disruption, destructive consequences, business interruption, later identification of malicious command-execution activity.
Not publicly established: final attribution and claimed 200,000-device figure.
